  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the implementation of the PEGASE programmes of Direct Financial Support to the Palestinian Authority (&apos;&apos;PEGASE DFS&apos;&apos;): ex-ante verification and assessment services 2024-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The contract will provide ex-ante verification and assessment services to support the implementation of the PEGASE DFS programme of Support to the Palestinian Administration Services &#xBF;CSP&#xBF;, the Social Protection System &#xBF;CTP&#xBF;, East Jerusalem Hospitals &#xBF;EJH&#xBF;, the support to the COVID19 Vaccination Campaign and the Industrial Estate Incentive Programme (PIEIP)&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
